===Week 3: TV Night===
''Individual judges scores in the chart below (given in parentheses) are listed in this order from left to right: Carrie Ann Inaba, [[Alfonso Ribeiro]], Julianne Hough, Bruno Tonioli.''

The couples performed one unlearned dance to famous television theme songs. Couples are listed in the order they performed.

After suffering a [[Transient ischemic attack|mini-stroke]], [[Kim Zolciak-Biermann]] was unable to attend the dress rehearsal and live show, and had to withdraw from the competition. Her partner, [[Tony Dovolani]], performed their samba routine during the live show with [[Jenna Johnson (dancer)|Jenna Johnson]].<ref>{{cite news|title=Kim Zolciak-Biermann Exits 'Dancing with the Stars' Following Mini-Stroke|url=https://variety.com/2015/tv/news/kim-zolciak-leaves-dancing-with-the-stars-mini-stroke-1201604533/|access-date=October 3, 2015|publisher=Variety|date=September 28, 2015|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20151002085336/http://variety.com/2015/tv/news/kim-zolciak-leaves-dancing-with-the-stars-mini-stroke-1201604533/|archive-date=October 2, 2015|url-status=live}}</ref> There was no additional elimination.

